# Cursor Rules for OpenMark

## Project

Chrome Manifest V3 extension. Renders .md files with syntax highlighting, mermaid, katex, file explorer, editor, AI chat.

## Tech Stack

- TypeScript (strict), Vite, Manifest V3
- markdown-it, highlight.js, mermaid, KaTeX (all bundled in one IIFE content script)
- No React/Vue/frameworks — vanilla DOM manipulation

## Build

```bash
npm run build  # tsc --noEmit && vite build && python3 scripts/ascii-escape-content.py && vite build --config vite.config.pages.ts
```

## Architecture

- `src/content/` → single IIFE bundle (`dist/content.js`, ~4MB with mermaid)
- `src/background/` → ES module service worker
- `src/shared/` → types + storage helpers shared between content/popup/options/background
- `public/manifest.json` → extension manifest (version source of truth)

## Important Constraints

- NEVER use innerHTML with interpolated user content (XSS). Use createElement + textContent.
- Mermaid is bundled directly in content.js. Do NOT externalize or inject as script tag.
- ASCII-escape post-build is required for Chrome Web Store (Unicode in JS = rejection).
- package.json and manifest.json versions must match.
- Editor input handler must set `renderFromEditor = true` before calling renderContent.
- File explorer parses Chrome's `addRow(name, url, isDir, ...)` format from file:// directory fetches.
- Background worker validates `sender.id === chrome.runtime.id` and `file://` scheme on all fetch proxying.

## Style

- No comments unless explaining a non-obvious constraint or workaround
- Prefer `document.createElement` over innerHTML for dynamic content
- Use chrome.storage.sync for settings, chrome.storage.local for ephemeral UI state
- Functions should be small and single-purpose
- No frameworks, no abstractions beyond what the feature requires

## File Guide

| Task | File |
|------|------|
| Add right panel tab | `src/content/flyoutMenu.ts` |
| Add background message handler | `src/background/index.ts` |
| Change rendering | `src/content/renderer.ts` |
| Modify layout DOM | `src/content/layout.ts` |
| Add/change styles | `src/content/styles/main.css` |
| Add setting | `src/shared/types.ts` (Settings interface + DEFAULT_SETTINGS) |
| Add AI provider | `src/content/aiChat.ts` |
